{
  "program": "FMTB",
  "phase": 10,
  "name": "The Chiseled Mom Workout",
  "intro": "2 sets. Each lettered group is a circuit: do every exercise in it back to back, then rest. This is the last program for Fit Mom-To-Be.  By this time you should be in your last month of pregnancy.  Which means you are more uncomfortable, you have lower pelvic pressure and maybe even pain, and you may even be somewhat dilated.  So at this point and the last phase we really cut back on intensity and volume.  You will see its high reps because at this point it will be hard to lift heavy weight so use lighter weight and for lower body you may even just use body weight because lower pelvic pressure is so present.  You will also see 2-3 sets.  Do whatever your energy level and comfort allows you to.  It may vary from day to day and workout to workout and that is ok.  Time to slow it down and get ready for delivery. Good luck!",
